sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-specimen-match> .

    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-specimen-match-1> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "media/levin_youtube_channel_math_synthesis.png (generated output)" ;
        dcterms:description "6-panel plate (SHA-256 93541cfb...; docs/ copy identical; re-rendered here from the solvers and visually identical). Every curve is a computation output and every law has a panel. No specimen, no source-figure overlay, no digitised published datum appears in any panel — media/levin_youtube_channel_math_synthesis.png: rendered output of models/2026-levin-channel-math-synthesis.py, not present when the audit was snapshotted (unfingerprinted)" .

    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-specimen-match-2> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "sorting-morphogenesis/figures/quantifying_emergence_ce2_metrics.json L207–L275" ;
        dcterms:description "Block '6': det 0.8687 / deg 0.0192 / cp 0.8496 (micro_swap), cp_I 0.9687, cp_E 0.5971, Delta CP_I 0.1191, Delta CP_E -0.2525; the only externally produced numbers in the suite, from the repository's own S_6 sorting simulation" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987ff10/sorting-morphogenesis/figures/quantifying_emergence_ce2_metrics.json#L207-L275> .

    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-specimen-match> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "@drmichaellevin 8-law mathematical synthesis & biological-law-criteria suite — Morphological realism / specimen match: 24/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-24"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Unchanged. The module is a cross-law synthesis/aggregator and has no specimen of its own: no organism, image, measurement table or published figure is loaded, overlaid or compared, and the one external dataset (the S_6 CE2 metrics) is the repository's own sorting simulation. Nothing in Pass 3.2 touches this; the four O1 laws still cite papers with published figures a synthesis module could overlay - Cervera 2020 (voltage profiles of coupled bistable cells), Pietak 2016 (BETSE concentration gradients), Chvykov 2021 (measured smarticle P_ss vs rattling), Pigozzi 2025 (conditioning success curves) - and none is used. The dimension is scored rather than marked not-applicable because 'biological law' status with T2 tags on three laws is claimed; the not-applicable counterfactual would renormalise the overall to 76.6, which the referee declines." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/specimen-match" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "models/2026-levin-channel-math-synthesis.py L61–L69: Inputs: the catalog (metadata), the CE2 metrics JSON (repository simulation output) and the Lean file. No biological dataset, image or published table is a declared input <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987ff10/models/2026-levin-channel-math-synthesis.py#L61-L69>",
            "models/2026-levin-channel-math-synthesis.py L716–L832: laws_table: every `metric` is a model-internal quantity (BVP reach, tail voltage of a synthetic chain, ratio of a constructed BVP, slope of a constructed CTMC, response of a hand-tuned 3-node ODE, threshold of a closed form); no entry is compared with a published measured value from the cited paper <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987ff10/models/2026-levin-channel-math-synthesis.py#L716-L832>" ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-specimen-match-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-specimen-match-2> ;
        pk:hasScore "0.24"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "unfaithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic; independent cross-provider MorphoEval referee, Pass 3 / 3.1 / 3.2)" ;
        dcterms:identifier "claude-fable-5-1" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf orcid:0009-0007-4948-9192 ;
        foaf:homepage <https://www.anthropic.com> .
}

